%% DM26-0670

sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Sign as polar-sign
    participant Processor as Scheduler processor
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Cassini
    participant Agent as Target agent
    participant Handler as Command handler

    Admin->>Sign: build and sign backup-now for the agent
    Sign-->>Admin: signed command with an id and an expiry
    Admin->>Processor: submit, by repository first, front door later
    Processor->>Graph: write a Command node and its status
    Processor->>Graph: mark it dispatched
    Processor-)Cassini: command on agent.name.command
    Cassini-)Agent: command

    Agent->>Agent: verify signer, target, authority and time
    Agent->>Agent: declared, arguments valid, not seen, not draining
    alt any check fails
        Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome refused and the step
    else every check passes
        Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome accepted
        Agent->>Handler: run with the declared timeout
        Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome started
        alt it finishes
            Handler-->>Agent: done
            Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome succeeded and how long
        else it fails or times out
            Handler-->>Agent: error
            Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome failed and why
        end
    end
    Cassini-)Processor: CommandOutcome
    Processor->>Graph: write an outcome node, linked to the command

    Note over Processor,Graph: Dispatched, but no outcome by the expiry
    Processor->>Graph: write unanswered, with no retry
    Admin->>Sign: a new command has a new id
